    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>subclass of :class:`~HTTPServerError`

This indicates that the client needs to authenticate to gain
network access.  From RFC 6585, &quot;Additional HTTP Status Codes&quot;.

code: 511, title: Network Authentication Required
</verbatim> </para>
